The runtime uses the MIT-licensed cosmolkit-inchi Rust source port of InChI
1.07.5. Its dependency license is retained under licenses/rust/. The original
IUPAC, InChI Trust and InChI Project notices are retained in LICENSE.
No official C InChI source is compiled into the runtime helper.

The source-port dependency includes the InChI SHA-256 algorithm; its original
INCHI_BASE/src/sha2.c and sha2.h carry this additional notice:

